s for Feb, Apr, Jul, Sep 1970\n- [x] Identify first available week in February data\n- [x] Identify last available week in April data\n- [x] Identify first available week in July data\n- [x] Identify last available week in September data\n- [ ] Calculate absolute percentage change Feb to Apr\n- [ ] Calculate absolute percentage change Jul to Sep\n- [ ] Calculate ratio and round to one decimal place\n- [ ] Write answer to /app/answer.txt"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"todo"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
